WEBVTT

01:41.479 --> 01:45.930
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.570 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 40]

01:49.479 --> 01:50.640
I am the tower,

01:51.509 --> 01:52.560
and the tower is me.

01:53.479 --> 01:54.789
As long as the Three Thousand Realms don't rise,

01:55.280 --> 01:56.840
I will be immortal and indestructible.

01:57.680 --> 01:59.350
What do you have to defeat me?

02:00.170 --> 02:01.400
Using your own mortal body

02:01.430 --> 02:02.790
to become such a heaven-defying evil being.

02:03.310 --> 02:04.680
Even if you enter the Three Thousand Realms,

02:05.100 --> 02:06.260
your cultivation will be completely destroyed,

02:06.590 --> 02:07.560
and you'll become a mortal!

02:08.030 --> 02:09.590
But with my talent,

02:09.970 --> 02:11.300
even if I have to start cultivating all over again,

02:11.810 --> 02:13.020
it won't take me long.

02:13.590 --> 02:14.750
If you don't comply with my wishes,

02:15.380 --> 02:16.910
I'll destroy another realm

02:17.490 --> 02:19.329
and rebuild the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

02:30.030 --> 02:31.079
Dun Tian has gone mad.

02:31.470 --> 02:33.000
We only have one option left now.

02:38.030 --> 02:38.710
Yu?

02:39.750 --> 02:41.030
He has been fighting with me for years.

02:41.310 --> 02:42.120
I know him well.

02:42.630 --> 02:43.630
In Su Yu's heart,

02:43.750 --> 02:44.680
there must still be attachment.

02:45.079 --> 02:46.470
He definitely won't bear to see this realm destroyed.

02:48.400 --> 02:49.010
Su Yu!

02:49.570 --> 02:50.610
Wake up!

02:52.590 --> 02:54.030
Su Yu is more than willing

02:54.410 --> 02:55.690
to come with me to the Three Thousand Realms.

02:56.200 --> 02:56.990
Su Yishui.

02:57.670 --> 02:58.760
Save your breath.

03:14.470 --> 03:15.080
Su Yu!

03:15.680 --> 03:16.960
If you can't protect the universe,

03:17.310 --> 03:18.870
hand your position over to me.

03:19.280 --> 03:20.079
Don't be a loser!

03:20.520 --> 03:21.079
Wake up!

03:34.520 --> 03:36.240
Yu, leave the altar!

03:36.620 --> 03:37.880
Don't let this realm be destroyed.

03:37.910 --> 03:38.870
Don't let Dun Tian get what he wants!

03:40.190 --> 03:40.750
Ranran?

03:41.590 --> 03:42.630
Su Yishui?

03:45.710 --> 03:46.240
Su Yu!

03:46.590 --> 03:47.840
You and I have been fighting for so many years.

03:48.280 --> 03:48.870
If you still have

03:48.870 --> 03:50.120
any dignity as the Crown Prince in your heart,

03:50.360 --> 03:51.310
step out of the altar!

03:51.710 --> 03:53.240
If you can't protect the universe, just admit it.

03:53.450 --> 03:54.079
Don't flee to

03:54.079 --> 03:55.079
the Three Thousand Realms like a deserter!

03:55.890 --> 03:57.210
Stop daydreaming!

03:57.670 --> 03:59.040
How could the two of you

03:59.430 --> 04:01.630
possibly make him waver?

04:01.910 --> 04:02.680
Su Yishui.

04:03.710 --> 04:05.120
You, a defeated opponent of mine,

04:05.520 --> 04:07.000
sure love to boast.

04:07.800 --> 04:08.960
The universe is mine.

04:09.560 --> 04:10.310
If anyone's going to protect it,

04:11.150 --> 04:12.280
it'll be me.

04:22.480 --> 04:23.480
Devil-breaking Cone?

04:28.680 --> 04:29.480
When I deliberately

04:29.480 --> 04:30.600
let you bring me here,

04:31.560 --> 04:33.430
I'd already had everything planned.

04:33.870 --> 04:34.800
Why?

04:38.830 --> 04:39.510
Our plan

04:39.510 --> 04:40.680
was about to succeed!

04:40.810 --> 04:42.070
Why are you doing this?

04:42.780 --> 04:43.480
Don't you want to live a life

04:43.510 --> 04:45.020
where all your wishes come true?

04:45.120 --> 04:45.750
I do!

04:47.800 --> 04:48.270
But...

04:49.830 --> 04:51.480
I can't picture what it looks like.

04:52.320 --> 04:54.080
It's great to have all your wishes come true,

04:54.800 --> 04:55.680
but not once,

04:55.800 --> 04:56.630
not even once,

04:56.630 --> 04:57.870
have I been able to truly imagine

04:57.890 --> 04:58.980
what that scene would be like!

05:00.160 --> 05:01.480
Maybe Feihua was right.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.190
A world like that

05:04.880 --> 05:06.320
ultimately doesn't belong to me.

05:10.330 --> 05:12.330
You really let me down.

05:16.310 --> 05:17.000
Right?

05:18.630 --> 05:19.720
I'm surprised too.

05:20.480 --> 05:21.630
Setbacks

05:22.720 --> 05:23.800
are unavoidable in life.

05:25.270 --> 05:26.560
But each one of these setbacks

05:27.630 --> 05:29.430
is unique.

05:30.360 --> 05:31.430
Some people hate me,

05:32.950 --> 05:34.120
while others love me.

05:34.750 --> 05:36.000
Some reject me,

05:37.100 --> 05:38.450
while others cherish me.

05:39.680 --> 05:41.120
These experiences alternate,

05:43.159 --> 05:44.240
filling my memories.

05:47.870 --> 05:49.040
But looking back now,

05:52.190 --> 05:53.390
every single one

05:54.560 --> 05:56.000
is deeply etched in my heart.

05:59.159 --> 05:59.830
Dun Tian!

06:01.600 --> 06:03.190
I know you won't let me go!

06:04.560 --> 06:05.430
And neither will I

06:07.120 --> 06:08.430
forgive myself.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.470
Ranran.

06:38.950 --> 06:39.720
Ranran!

06:40.800 --> 06:41.830
Tell Feihua that

06:42.750 --> 06:44.190
I'm grateful to her for waking me up.

06:47.600 --> 06:48.510
In this life,

06:52.010 --> 06:53.210
I've actually lived

06:58.240 --> 06:59.159
quite well.

07:03.390 --> 07:04.190
Yu!

07:17.560 --> 07:18.510
It's okay.

07:19.270 --> 07:20.480
Even though both of you are dead,

07:20.480 --> 07:21.480
it's okay.

07:22.180 --> 07:22.800
You'll become

07:22.830 --> 07:24.190
nourishment for the Three Thousand Realms Tower!

07:35.880 --> 07:36.710
There's still time.

07:37.240 --> 07:38.630
Even though they died, there's still time.

07:39.360 --> 07:41.159
The Three Thousand Realms Tower is about to mature.

07:41.950 --> 07:43.430
Everything is still in time!

07:45.830 --> 07:46.800
Shui, look.

07:47.390 --> 07:49.120
Someone with a death wish is having second thoughts.

07:49.800 --> 07:50.360
The power Dun Tian is using

07:50.920 --> 07:52.510
to absorb the Three Thousand Realms Tower

07:52.510 --> 07:53.430
has a flaw.

07:53.750 --> 07:54.430
This is the chance

07:54.430 --> 07:55.430
Yu left for us.

08:01.040 --> 08:01.680
I'll hold him off.

08:02.270 --> 08:03.070
You go to the top of the tower.

08:03.920 --> 08:05.160
This tower is almost complete.

08:05.630 --> 08:06.920
Dun Tian's been absorbing the power of all realms.

08:06.950 --> 08:07.720
It will only make him stronger.

08:07.830 --> 08:08.190
You...

08:08.310 --> 08:08.800
Don't worry.

08:09.650 --> 08:11.000
I'll do everything to stop him,

08:11.650 --> 08:13.320
and I'll fight even harder to stay alive and be with you.

08:24.360 --> 08:24.870
Go!

08:48.160 --> 08:48.990
You've opened the sea of Qi

08:49.510 --> 08:50.270
and penetrated the immortal power.

08:51.000 --> 08:51.750
It seems you also know that

08:51.750 --> 08:52.870
this is the last moment

08:52.870 --> 08:53.750
of your life.

08:54.720 --> 08:56.010
You're really going all out.

08:57.720 --> 08:58.960
A battle to the death.

08:59.390 --> 09:00.320
As it should be.

09:13.440 --> 09:14.480
A diversion?

09:15.000 --> 09:15.750
You're seeking death!

09:33.510 --> 09:34.240
Impressive.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.240
You actually managed to use your mortal body

09:36.630 --> 09:37.390
to forcefully pass through

09:37.390 --> 09:38.630
the spatial gate I tore open.

09:39.960 --> 09:40.630
I told you,

09:41.200 --> 09:42.910
a battle to the death should be like this.

09:43.630 --> 09:44.320
Quickly, to the top of the tower.

10:26.960 --> 10:28.670
I'll kill you both at once!

10:32.470 --> 10:33.030
Sword of Non-Attachment!

10:34.750 --> 10:35.630
You've been with me for so many years.

10:36.060 --> 10:37.630
Today, our souls and lives intertwine.

10:37.720 --> 10:38.870
We swear to protect Ranran with our lives.

10:47.510 --> 10:48.200
Shui!

10:48.750 --> 10:49.630
Just focus on destroying the tower!

11:36.550 --> 11:37.270
How are you?

11:39.870 --> 11:40.510
Dun Tian!

11:42.960 --> 11:43.670
It's over!

11:45.000 --> 11:46.030
I won't lose.

11:46.550 --> 11:47.790
Everything I've lost

11:48.440 --> 11:49.840
will come back!

11:55.320 --> 11:57.550
Foul and evil spirits of the Three Thousand Realms!

11:58.240 --> 12:00.320
I offer everything in this realm as sacrifice!

12:00.750 --> 12:02.270
I offer myself as sacrifice!

12:03.150 --> 12:03.870
Come on!

12:04.510 --> 12:06.360
Feast on my flesh and blood!

12:06.510 --> 12:08.670
Help me open the Three Thousand Realms!

12:40.240 --> 12:41.670
You defied heaven!

12:43.080 --> 12:44.240
Your crimes are unforgivable!

12:57.030 --> 12:57.910
Dragon Goddess.

12:59.750 --> 13:00.480
Immortals.

13:01.750 --> 13:03.560
You've actually descended to the mortal world!

13:05.220 --> 13:06.460
You sealed off the passage from the Dragon Island

13:06.480 --> 13:07.830
to the Immortal Realm.

13:08.600 --> 13:10.390
Fortunately, Xue Ranran and Su Yishui

13:10.510 --> 13:12.140
destroyed the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

13:12.480 --> 13:13.550
allowing us to arrive in time.

13:14.390 --> 13:15.200
Dun Tian.

13:15.440 --> 13:17.750
Your ambition ends here.

13:32.550 --> 13:33.600
The Three Thousand Realms.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.040
My Three Thousand Realms.

13:41.750 --> 13:42.800
My Three Thousand Realms...

13:43.320 --> 13:44.320
My Three Thousand Realms...

13:48.870 --> 13:50.150
The Three Thousand Realms are an illusion.

13:51.280 --> 13:52.800
Your remorse for your wife and children

13:53.910 --> 13:54.840
is even more illusory.

13:59.240 --> 14:01.360
My family should have reunited.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.400
It's all because of you.

14:04.920 --> 14:06.510
It's all your fault!

14:07.790 --> 14:09.440
The affection that belonged to you

14:09.930 --> 14:11.090
and the bond you had with them

14:11.120 --> 14:12.550
had already ended and severed

14:12.900 --> 14:13.850
when you watched them die before your eyes.

14:14.920 --> 14:16.110
You're too selfish.

14:16.960 --> 14:18.510
You abandoned them first,

14:19.030 --> 14:19.670
yet for the sake of

14:19.670 --> 14:21.080
your own pathetic regret,

14:21.440 --> 14:22.870
you dragged an entire realm to perish with you.

14:23.960 --> 14:24.750
For someone like you,

14:25.270 --> 14:26.550
even if your wife and children were to be resurrected,

14:27.150 --> 14:28.510
they would see you as a devil

14:29.150 --> 14:30.240
and avoid you at all costs.

14:31.150 --> 14:32.470
I... I...

14:37.890 --> 14:39.050
Mom, you made chicken drumsticks.

14:39.080 --> 14:40.080
They smell so good.

14:44.690 --> 14:46.450
Darling, dinner's ready.

14:47.730 --> 14:48.600
Rong Yao.

14:49.500 --> 14:50.930
Dad, hurry up,

14:50.960 --> 14:52.480
or I'll finish all the drumsticks.

14:56.120 --> 14:56.750
Yu'er.

14:58.790 --> 14:59.270
Dad.

14:59.480 --> 15:00.600
She's really eating them.

15:00.790 --> 15:01.790
She won't leave any for you.

15:06.550 --> 15:07.240
Wan'er.

15:08.440 --> 15:11.480
♫In March, we make rice milk♫

15:11.960 --> 15:14.630
♫And bring it to our daughter for a taste♫

15:15.200 --> 15:18.360
♫In April, we make wine♫

15:16.200 --> 15:17.080
Rong Yao!

15:18.790 --> 15:21.480
♫If you miss it for a day♫

15:21.930 --> 15:24.930
♫You'll feel restless♫

16:18.750 --> 16:20.030
Thanks to your timely arrival, Dragon Goddess.

16:20.670 --> 16:21.670
Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.360
If it weren't for you,

16:23.750 --> 16:25.200
I and those guys from the Immortal Realm

16:25.360 --> 16:26.630
would have been helpless too.

16:27.480 --> 16:28.750
Qing Luo is seriously injured.

16:29.080 --> 16:30.480
It'll take some time for her to recover.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.550
The Dragon Clan has a long lifespan.

16:33.150 --> 16:34.120
Even with severe injuries,

16:34.520 --> 16:36.290
a hundred years of recuperation should suffice.

16:38.510 --> 16:39.440
What I'm more worried about is you.

16:40.080 --> 16:41.960
Not to mention your physical injuries,

16:42.640 --> 16:43.670
the entire land

16:43.910 --> 16:45.510
has been completely destroyed.

16:45.870 --> 16:46.670
What do you plan to do?

16:49.120 --> 16:50.390
Although the human clan has short lifespans,

16:51.480 --> 16:52.510
we're endlessly regenerating.

16:53.390 --> 16:53.960
That's right.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.360
Together,

16:57.100 --> 16:58.490
we can surely bring everything back to life.

16:59.000 --> 16:59.840
Good kids.

17:00.480 --> 17:01.510
I can't stay long.

17:02.030 --> 17:03.630
I need to take Qing Luo and leave first.

17:04.400 --> 17:05.270
If you have time,

17:05.589 --> 17:06.829
come visit Dragon Island again.

17:07.310 --> 17:08.349
You're welcome anytime.

17:16.310 --> 17:16.960
Let's go.

17:28.480 --> 17:29.070
Master!

17:30.150 --> 17:31.280
Master. Ranran.

17:31.310 --> 17:31.750
Stiffly Su.

17:31.830 --> 17:32.400
Ranran.

17:32.750 --> 17:33.440
You're safe and sound.

17:33.680 --> 17:34.240
That's great.

17:34.550 --> 17:35.070
Xi'er.

17:35.570 --> 17:36.720
We should be happy

17:36.750 --> 17:37.830
that Master and Ranran are both okay.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.200
Stop crying.

17:39.590 --> 17:40.200
Indeed.

17:40.790 --> 17:42.510
They've also protected this part of the world.

17:42.830 --> 17:43.590
It's a great joy.

17:44.240 --> 17:44.790
Good.

17:45.400 --> 17:46.030
It's good that you're both safe.

17:46.680 --> 17:47.310
It's good that everything's okay now.

17:48.880 --> 17:49.960
You risked your lives without hesitation

17:50.310 --> 17:51.160
and saved all living beings

17:51.160 --> 17:52.270
in the midst of danger.

17:52.590 --> 17:54.310
You've indeed set a good example for all Heavenly Sects.

17:55.310 --> 17:55.920
Indeed.

17:56.480 --> 17:58.200
Please accept our bow.

18:01.350 --> 18:02.200
We are the same.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.510
There's no need for such formalities.

18:04.070 --> 18:04.830
We saved the world,

18:05.000 --> 18:05.880
but it was also to save ourselves.

18:06.420 --> 18:07.370
Moreover, it was only because you all fought outside the mountain

18:07.400 --> 18:08.270
and risked your lives to protect it

18:08.480 --> 18:09.240
that this land didn't

18:09.510 --> 18:11.240
become a wasteland.

18:11.850 --> 18:12.550
This matter is settled,

18:12.790 --> 18:13.640
but there's more to be done in the future.

18:14.000 --> 18:15.550
Let's help the people rebuild their homes first.

18:15.830 --> 18:16.550
That's the priority for now.

18:16.830 --> 18:17.880
That's right.

18:18.550 --> 18:19.480
We've all expressed our thanks.

18:19.720 --> 18:20.480
Everyone, disperse

18:20.680 --> 18:21.880
and get some real work done.

18:24.640 --> 18:25.960
Sovereign Wei, you were severely injured.

18:26.150 --> 18:27.110
Are you able to walk now?

18:28.790 --> 18:29.830
Even if I can't, I have to.

18:30.920 --> 18:32.070
My bones were already broken,

18:32.470 --> 18:33.920
and I was thrown out of that space.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.110
So unlucky.

18:36.610 --> 18:37.700
I protected his vital meridians.

18:37.830 --> 18:38.790
Even severe injuries won't be a problem.

18:40.920 --> 18:42.160
You make it sound so easy.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.550
I'm in a lot of pain.

18:45.920 --> 18:46.480
Forget it.

18:47.190 --> 18:47.990
I won't argue with you.

18:55.830 --> 18:57.350
They say the Celestial Sect is a Demonic Sect,

18:57.680 --> 18:59.550
but Sovereign Wei and Elder Tu,

18:59.790 --> 19:01.310
you showed great righteousness in the face of adversity.

19:01.550 --> 19:02.590
Even we of the Heavenly Sects

19:02.830 --> 19:03.720
are not comparable.

19:06.200 --> 19:07.000
From today on,

19:07.330 --> 19:08.110
immortal cultivators

19:08.110 --> 19:09.440
will no longer be divided into Heavenly and Demonic Sects.

19:10.050 --> 19:11.210
As long as one does righteous deeds,

19:11.750 --> 19:12.750
the universe is one big family.

19:16.270 --> 19:17.550
Who's family with you?

19:18.110 --> 19:19.550
We're still the top Demonic Sect.

19:19.960 --> 19:21.030
I'm still the big devil.

19:21.440 --> 19:21.920
You...

19:22.160 --> 19:23.750
If you see me in the future

19:24.120 --> 19:25.510
and dare to come greet me or pay respects,

19:26.030 --> 19:27.110
I'll beat you up.

19:32.000 --> 19:32.680
Ranran.

19:33.030 --> 19:33.640
Yishui.

19:34.350 --> 19:35.440
Do you have any plans?

19:36.350 --> 19:37.110
Plans?

19:37.400 --> 19:38.590
Now that Mount Wester has been destroyed,

19:39.030 --> 19:39.880
it's uninhabitable.

19:40.270 --> 19:41.240
If you don't mind,

19:41.550 --> 19:42.680
you can come to Mount Hollow with us.

19:42.950 --> 19:44.460
Although its spiritual channel is damaged,

19:44.880 --> 19:46.310
it's still an immortal mountain after all.

19:47.510 --> 19:49.240
The Eternal Sect is also willing to accept everyone from the Wester Sect.

19:49.960 --> 19:50.790
All the Heavenly Sects of the universe

19:51.360 --> 19:52.040
are open for you to choose.

19:52.400 --> 19:52.830
Ranran.

19:52.960 --> 19:54.440
Come to Mount Cuiwei.

19:55.000 --> 19:55.510
This way,

19:55.640 --> 19:57.110
we can brew good wine together,

19:57.310 --> 19:57.880
right?

19:58.270 --> 19:58.920
Exactly.

19:59.240 --> 20:00.400
Drinking from dawn to dusk every day,

20:00.510 --> 20:01.640
wouldn't that be delightful?

20:02.070 --> 20:02.960
Thank you for your kind offer,

20:03.750 --> 20:04.680
but Mount Wester is fine.

20:08.720 --> 20:09.920
What Shui means is that

20:10.310 --> 20:12.030
Mount Wester will always be our home.

20:15.440 --> 20:16.350
It won't be long

20:16.720 --> 20:18.240
before Mount Wester returns to its original state.

20:18.640 --> 20:19.200
When that time comes,

20:19.480 --> 20:20.440
we'd like to invite you all to come and drink.

20:21.200 --> 20:21.920
Sounds good.

21:37.720 --> 21:38.830
Making me come all this way,

21:39.030 --> 21:41.160
carrying two jars of Mistaken Divine up Mount Absolute,

21:42.000 --> 21:43.110
not even knowing what for.

21:45.680 --> 21:47.000
And he's not even here.

21:47.750 --> 21:48.640
Shui.

21:51.030 --> 21:52.070
Su Yishui!

21:59.310 --> 22:00.480
Today is the Qixi Festival.

22:01.480 --> 22:02.400
I asked you to come up Mount Absolute

22:02.830 --> 22:03.920
to see the lanterns.

22:04.480 --> 22:06.310
Everyone else goes to the riverside to release lanterns,

22:06.720 --> 22:08.070
but you insist on coming to the mountaintop.

22:08.700 --> 22:09.370
Why should my lanterns

22:09.400 --> 22:10.510
be the same as everyone else's?

22:11.480 --> 22:12.270
This Reincarnation Tree

22:13.070 --> 22:14.160
means a lot to me.

22:14.880 --> 22:16.640
This is where I want to be.

22:18.550 --> 22:19.160
Alright, alright.

22:19.550 --> 22:21.030
We've seen the lanterns. Let's start drinking.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.030
Why rush to drink?

22:23.830 --> 22:24.880
We've got work to do.

22:26.670 --> 22:28.110
The lanterns have all been lit.

22:28.310 --> 22:29.350
What else is there to do?

22:30.250 --> 22:31.210
On the Qixi Festival, when releasing lanterns,

22:31.240 --> 22:32.400
you're supposed to write love messages.

22:32.750 --> 22:33.350
Have you written any?

22:34.310 --> 22:34.830
Fine.

22:35.310 --> 22:36.000
Give me one.

22:36.680 --> 22:37.550
I'll write some for you.

22:39.110 --> 22:39.720
One?

22:40.710 --> 22:42.400
I bought dozens of lanterns.

22:42.880 --> 22:44.240
You want me to write on all of them?

22:45.480 --> 22:46.680
I'm not a chatterbox.

22:46.750 --> 22:47.960
How can I come up with so many love messages?

22:49.960 --> 22:51.110
We have a long future

22:51.400 --> 22:52.160
ahead of us.

22:52.640 --> 22:54.200
Can't you write even a few dozen love messages?

22:55.130 --> 22:55.960
If you can't write them well,

22:57.110 --> 22:58.030
don't even think about drinking.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.480
I'll watch you write.

22:59.920 --> 23:00.750
You need supervision.

23:01.240 --> 23:02.880
Why do I need supervision?

23:03.350 --> 23:05.160
So many young Heavenly disciples

23:05.400 --> 23:07.000
have been captivated by you.

23:07.350 --> 23:08.270
Of course you need supervision.

23:10.680 --> 23:12.400
Sovereign Su, you're no less popular.

23:12.640 --> 23:13.440
Over the past three years,

23:13.590 --> 23:14.960
countless female Immortal Masters

23:15.070 --> 23:16.680
have been sending gifts to Mount Wester like flowing water.

23:17.070 --> 23:18.070
So, Sovereign Su,

23:18.480 --> 23:19.880
I shouldn't be the only one writing love messages.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.070
You should write with me.

23:22.000 --> 23:22.680
Moreover...

23:26.590 --> 23:27.270
Sword of Non-Attachment?

23:27.730 --> 23:28.800
Alcohol Immortal and Liang Wumeng

23:28.830 --> 23:29.720
searched everywhere for craftsmen,

23:30.020 --> 23:31.500
and it took them three years to repair it.

23:31.640 --> 23:32.550
If you don't write,

23:33.400 --> 23:34.200
I won't let you have it.

23:35.480 --> 23:35.920
Alright.

23:36.640 --> 23:37.680
But forget about the love messages.

23:38.400 --> 23:40.240
I have something I'd rather do than write love messages.

23:46.090 --> 23:48.430
♫Ripples shimmer among the flowers♫

23:48.630 --> 23:51.220
♫The wind plucks the clouds in the sky♫

23:51.590 --> 23:55.540
♫Because of you, my fleeting life is filled with endless thoughts♫

23:56.420 --> 23:59.430
♫Since my lips touched your beauty♫

23:59.780 --> 24:02.040
♫I envy nothing in this world♫

24:03.030 --> 24:06.820
♫Even butterflies and swallows gift us their graceful dance♫

24:08.090 --> 24:10.500
♫If the full moon is destined to wane♫

24:10.630 --> 24:13.510
♫If time is bound to change everything♫

24:13.760 --> 24:17.920
♫Then I wish to follow you like a migrating bird♫

24:18.110 --> 24:21.420
♫Never tired of gazing at you, longing for you day and night♫

24:21.440 --> 24:24.420
♫I wish to be with you forever♫

24:24.200 --> 24:24.750
Eat more.

24:24.640 --> 24:29.050
♫Braving every trial and tribulation♫

24:25.110 --> 24:26.480
Master, Ranran.

24:26.960 --> 24:27.550
Bad news.

24:27.760 --> 24:28.690
Just now, Sovereign Wei, Wei Jiu,

24:28.720 --> 24:29.310
broke into Mount Wester.

24:29.310 --> 24:30.750
He went to Consonance Palace to see Elder Tu.

24:32.400 --> 24:34.070
You let her hide from Wei Jiu in the Consonance Palace,

24:34.880 --> 24:36.160
but she'll have to face him eventually.

24:37.160 --> 24:38.880
Three years ago, she had nowhere to go.

24:39.070 --> 24:40.070
We had to help her, didn't we?

24:42.480 --> 24:43.070
Oh no.

24:44.240 --> 24:44.720
What?

24:45.400 --> 24:46.030
In front of Consonance Palace,

24:46.030 --> 24:47.110
there's the new sword formation we just set up.

24:47.720 --> 24:49.070
Wei Jiu doesn't have Mount Wester's token.

24:49.350 --> 24:50.110
If he barges in recklessly,

24:50.310 --> 24:51.480
the sword formation will definitely be activated.

24:56.070 --> 24:56.510
Guardian.

24:56.590 --> 24:57.030
Guardian.

24:58.240 --> 24:58.920
Senior!

24:59.400 --> 25:00.920
I beg you to see me!

25:23.920 --> 25:24.600
I'm here.

25:25.310 --> 25:26.160
What do you want to say?

25:26.270 --> 25:26.720
Go ahead.

25:30.590 --> 25:31.240
Senior.

25:32.430 --> 25:33.070
I was wrong.

25:34.680 --> 25:35.680
I was very wrong.

25:36.350 --> 25:37.920
I came just to tell you that

25:38.510 --> 25:39.720
I truly regret my actions.

25:43.310 --> 25:44.550
I've raised many butterflies.

25:46.920 --> 25:47.680
In the valley to the west

25:48.200 --> 25:49.590
of Mount Scarlet Flame,

25:50.920 --> 25:52.550
I've raised many butterflies for you.

25:53.550 --> 25:54.270
Now,

25:55.270 --> 25:56.510
that place is called Butterfly Valley.

25:57.790 --> 25:59.440
You don't have to avoid the Celestial Sect because of me.

26:00.420 --> 26:01.210
I'm leaving.

26:02.680 --> 26:04.030
If you ever return to Mount Scarlet Flame,

26:05.030 --> 26:05.830
please go and see it.

26:11.960 --> 26:12.880
My wish has been fulfilled.

26:14.000 --> 26:14.640
Let's

26:15.860 --> 26:16.720
part ways here.

26:21.150 --> 26:22.370
Are you abandoning our sect?

26:22.400 --> 26:23.030
Where are you going?

26:23.960 --> 26:24.750
To seclude myself and reflect on my mistakes.

26:25.960 --> 26:26.480
You can't leave.

26:27.160 --> 26:28.920
The old sovereign entrusted everything to you,

26:29.400 --> 26:30.640
yet you're hiding away to reflect?

26:31.510 --> 26:32.550
You're just slacking off, aren't you?

26:33.160 --> 26:34.240
If you truly want to reflect,

26:34.660 --> 26:35.800
make amends for your past mistakes

26:35.820 --> 26:36.750
and revitalize the Demonic Sect.

26:38.310 --> 26:39.440
It's not that I don't want to.

26:40.590 --> 26:41.480
It's just that in the past,

26:42.640 --> 26:44.270
you were always there, fighting by my side.

26:46.240 --> 26:47.070
But now,

26:48.500 --> 26:49.370
I've lost the person

26:49.400 --> 26:50.240
I relied on the most.

26:51.350 --> 26:52.830
I'm too ashamed to revitalize the Demonic Sect.

26:54.310 --> 26:54.790
Fine.

26:57.440 --> 26:58.000
One year.

26:58.750 --> 26:59.680
I'll help you for one year.

27:01.590 --> 27:02.750
If during this year,

27:03.380 --> 27:04.540
your actions

27:04.720 --> 27:06.110
live up to the old sovereign's trust,

27:07.000 --> 27:08.240
I'll extend it for another year.

27:09.480 --> 27:10.440
Until I'm sure

27:11.150 --> 27:12.580
you've completely reformed.

27:13.720 --> 27:14.270
Really?

27:15.000 --> 27:16.310
Don't think this means I've forgiven you.

27:17.310 --> 27:17.960
I just don't want

27:18.680 --> 27:20.310
to let the old sovereign down. That's all.

27:21.070 --> 27:21.440
Okay.

27:22.000 --> 27:22.400
Okay.

27:22.680 --> 27:23.240
Okay.

27:23.960 --> 27:24.640
I'll take you...

27:25.590 --> 27:26.000
No,

27:26.920 --> 27:27.640
I'll welcome you back right now.

27:35.350 --> 27:36.240
You're always like this,

27:37.000 --> 27:37.960
covered in wounds.

27:39.730 --> 27:40.480
I wonder if

27:40.510 --> 27:41.550
you're doing this on purpose, trying to soften my heart.

27:42.720 --> 27:43.200
I wouldn't dare.

27:43.550 --> 27:43.960
I...

27:48.230 --> 27:49.000
I wouldn't dare.

27:53.400 --> 27:54.070
Bai Baishan.

27:54.750 --> 27:55.310
From today onwards,

27:55.790 --> 27:57.030
the position of Wester Sect's sovereign

27:57.240 --> 27:58.000
will be entrusted to you.

27:58.750 --> 27:59.550
Master.

28:01.960 --> 28:03.680
Have I done something wrong again?

28:04.200 --> 28:05.160
You've done well these years.

28:05.550 --> 28:06.310
What wrongdoing are you talking about?

28:06.960 --> 28:07.590
Please rise.

28:12.640 --> 28:13.200
It's just that I no longer want

28:13.220 --> 28:14.300
to be the sovereign of Wester Sect.

28:14.720 --> 28:15.790
You are the senior disciple of Wester Sect,

28:16.030 --> 28:17.000
so of course you should succeed me.

28:19.640 --> 28:20.510
Master.

28:21.350 --> 28:21.920
I've

28:23.000 --> 28:24.160
made a grave mistake in the past.

28:24.400 --> 28:25.000
Senior Bai.

28:25.510 --> 28:26.750
Who doesn't make mistakes?

28:27.240 --> 28:28.680
You've been working day and night, tirelessly rebuilding Mount Wester

28:29.000 --> 28:29.880
for the past three years.

28:30.480 --> 28:31.640
Everyone admires you for it.

28:32.920 --> 28:33.920
The position of sovereign is rightfully yours.

28:34.160 --> 28:35.030
It's only fitting.

28:36.440 --> 28:37.830
Stop making excuses.

28:38.240 --> 28:39.000
Do you want to break

28:39.000 --> 28:39.830
the lineage of Wester Sect?

28:41.440 --> 28:42.090
Accept the token.

28:42.030 --> 28:42.810
[Wester Sect]

28:51.880 --> 28:53.160
I'll definitely make Wester Sect

28:54.550 --> 28:55.440
prosper and flourish.

28:57.480 --> 28:58.350
Our Wester Sect

28:58.550 --> 28:59.590
doesn't have to be too prosperous.

28:59.920 --> 29:00.720
Just let it be as it may.

29:02.350 --> 29:03.110
I'll do my best.

29:05.830 --> 29:07.030
Here's the guest list

29:05.850 --> 29:07.330
[Guest List] [Gift List]

29:07.790 --> 29:08.350
and gift list for the wedding banquet.

29:10.750 --> 29:11.270
Wedding banquet?

29:11.880 --> 29:12.790
Gift list?

29:14.960 --> 29:16.400
We promised each other three years ago

29:16.690 --> 29:18.100
to get married after Mount Wester was rebuilt.

29:18.760 --> 29:19.680
Now it's time.

29:21.920 --> 29:23.000
My wedding with Ranran

29:24.160 --> 29:25.120
will be held at Mount Wester.

29:25.840 --> 29:26.720
No wonder

29:26.750 --> 29:27.790
so many boxes were brought in today.

29:28.400 --> 29:30.070
It turns out they were part of the wedding preparations.

29:31.160 --> 29:31.960
It's a great joy.

29:32.110 --> 29:33.240
It's truly a tremendous joy.

29:36.550 --> 29:37.830
Since this is the first major task

29:37.920 --> 29:38.750
after I took over as sovereign,

29:39.150 --> 29:40.350
Master, Ranran,

29:40.930 --> 29:42.070
why not let me take charge

29:42.680 --> 29:44.160
of the wedding arrangements?

29:46.750 --> 29:47.310
Senior Bai.

29:47.750 --> 29:49.070
The wedding is really too complicated.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.510
It made my head spin just hearing about it.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.640
My lifelong commitment with Master

29:53.070 --> 29:54.000
is entirely in your hands now.

29:55.240 --> 29:56.640
Everyone, be quick with your hands.

29:56.960 --> 29:57.870
Work faster.

29:57.940 --> 29:59.220
Be careful, don't drop anything.

29:59.270 --> 30:00.310
Don't worry, Mr. Zeng.

30:00.790 --> 30:01.200
What,

30:01.640 --> 30:03.000
our sovereign of Wester Sect

30:03.030 --> 30:04.240
can't even handle this little task?

30:05.650 --> 30:06.450
Mr. Zeng.

30:06.480 --> 30:07.440
Please don't tease me

30:07.460 --> 30:08.740
on such a joyous day.

30:47.680 --> 30:48.880
This is our actual wedding day.

30:49.310 --> 30:50.510
We haven't even completed the ceremony yet.

30:50.960 --> 30:52.160
Why did you come in here?

31:02.510 --> 31:03.440
I've come to bring you your wedding dress.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.550
I found a skilled craftsman,

31:08.350 --> 31:10.510
and it took him three years to complete the alterations.

31:11.070 --> 31:11.880
I just want you to wear

31:11.880 --> 31:13.000
the most beautiful wedding dress when you marry me.

31:14.200 --> 31:15.680
You've planned it all out, haven't you?

31:18.690 --> 31:19.210
For you,

31:19.620 --> 31:20.080
I must

31:20.110 --> 31:21.350
plan everything carefully.

31:25.920 --> 31:27.160
We're getting married tonight.

31:30.880 --> 31:31.960
Are you prepared?

31:33.480 --> 31:33.880
How...

31:34.270 --> 31:35.400
How should I prepare?

31:37.880 --> 31:39.510
They say you were a demoness in your past life,

31:40.550 --> 31:41.440
but now it seems

31:41.920 --> 31:43.270
to be illusory.

31:44.830 --> 31:46.350
Surely I'm not worthy of that name.

31:47.160 --> 31:48.270
What, Sovereign Su,

31:48.680 --> 31:49.400
does that mean you're very experienced?

31:51.480 --> 31:52.270
Well, not really.

31:53.720 --> 31:55.000
But for the past twenty-some years,

31:55.640 --> 31:57.480
a woman has appeared in my dreams a lot.

32:00.790 --> 32:02.030
She'd call me Shui

32:02.880 --> 32:03.640
while seducing me.

32:05.110 --> 32:06.240
Perhaps I've had so many dreams

32:06.790 --> 32:08.350
that I've learned it by myself.

32:09.110 --> 32:09.720
I've never heard of

32:09.740 --> 32:11.160
someone learning this in their dreams.

32:12.000 --> 32:12.680
Could the one who entered your dream

32:12.920 --> 32:13.750
be a fox demon?

32:17.790 --> 32:18.240
Then tonight,

32:18.270 --> 32:19.480
I'll carefully examine

32:20.350 --> 32:21.440
how many fox tails she has.

32:26.160 --> 32:26.510
You...

32:27.240 --> 32:28.310
Leave already.

32:28.790 --> 32:29.790
Don't disturb me while I'm getting ready.

32:50.920 --> 32:52.200
The ceremony of entering the hall begins.

32:52.480 --> 32:53.960
The bride, please enter.

33:12.440 --> 33:16.910
♫After parting, the black silk-like hair turned snow-white♫

33:17.560 --> 33:22.680
♫In secret, I've been missing you, dreaming about you for years♫

33:22.760 --> 33:27.840
♫Awaiting the destined love, a déjà vu so real♫

33:28.080 --> 33:35.120
♫I'd trade three lifetimes of grandeur for your one fleeting bliss♫

33:36.560 --> 33:40.980
♫Gradually gravitate toward you by love♫

33:39.790 --> 33:40.440
Everyone.

33:40.680 --> 33:41.440
What are you waiting for?

33:41.780 --> 33:46.870
♫Words are too weak to tell the whole story♫

33:41.880 --> 33:43.160
Quickly, block the door and ask for the wedding money.

33:43.750 --> 33:44.200
Right, right.

33:45.830 --> 33:46.400
Here. Here.

33:46.510 --> 33:47.270
The wedding money is here.

33:46.900 --> 33:51.690
♫Only after I met you♫

33:47.550 --> 33:47.960
Don't rush.

33:48.440 --> 33:49.160
There's enough for everyone.

33:52.010 --> 33:59.820
♫Did I realize there are heaven-like places all because of you♫

33:59.110 --> 33:59.480
Well...

33:59.590 --> 34:00.110
Actually, I

33:59.850 --> 34:05.020
♫Maybe we have not only the past♫

34:00.110 --> 34:01.310
don't care for these worldly things at all.

34:01.920 --> 34:03.000
I just want to bring some good fortune

34:03.030 --> 34:03.880
to our baby.

34:05.100 --> 34:06.680
Jiuyuan, it's all for you.

34:05.590 --> 34:09.900
♫But also the future with passion never fading away♫

34:09.710 --> 34:10.800
Saddle down.

34:10.420 --> 34:15.750
♫Write a long poem for the rest of our lives♫

34:13.150 --> 34:14.960
The bride, cross the saddle.

34:16.020 --> 34:20.900
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

34:32.469 --> 34:33.670
May flowers bloom in pairs,

34:33.840 --> 34:35.400
blessings and peace abound.

34:42.800 --> 34:47.820
♫Maybe a lifetime is too short, too fleeting♫

34:47.800 --> 34:50.030
First bow to heaven and earth.

34:47.840 --> 34:53.080
♫So we were granted a second chance♫

34:53.440 --> 34:58.490
♫Use our unfinished fate♫

35:02.480 --> 35:04.510
Second bow to the parents.

35:12.110 --> 35:13.880
The bride and the groom bow to each other.

35:14.810 --> 35:19.440
♫Just because I'm destined to reunite with you again♫

35:20.170 --> 35:24.730
♫Intertwined fates throughout reincarnation♫

35:25.560 --> 35:30.480
♫With endless time to write our story♫

35:26.340 --> 35:27.690
Ceremony completed.

35:30.790 --> 35:34.710
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

35:35.160 --> 35:40.210
♫From now onwards♫

35:38.440 --> 35:39.360
I wish the newlyweds

35:39.440 --> 35:40.920
a lifetime of love and respect.

35:41.110 --> 35:43.150
May your hearts be forever in harmony.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.190
Then we wish you

35:45.400 --> 35:46.280
a hundred years of good marriage.

35:46.800 --> 35:47.510
May you have children soon.

35:48.190 --> 35:50.110
I wish Master all the best.

35:50.630 --> 35:51.480
As for Su Yishui...

35:55.070 --> 35:57.280
Su Yishui, do more housework for Master.

36:01.030 --> 36:02.360
You call that a blessing?

36:03.440 --> 36:04.510
I wish you two

36:04.660 --> 36:06.680
be companions in this life,

36:06.880 --> 36:08.840
and continue your good fate for three lifetimes.

36:10.320 --> 36:10.840
Good.

36:11.630 --> 36:12.670
Then I wish you

36:13.280 --> 36:15.150
fine wine

36:16.240 --> 36:17.810
and no worries every day.

36:20.150 --> 36:22.070
I wish Master and Ranran

36:22.180 --> 36:23.270
a perfect match made in heaven,

36:23.480 --> 36:24.760
forever united in heart.

36:26.190 --> 36:26.840
Come on.

36:27.030 --> 36:27.760
Let's all raise our glasses

36:27.760 --> 36:29.000
to the bride and the groom.

36:33.670 --> 36:34.230
Come on.

36:34.880 --> 36:36.400
Let's drink this up together.

36:44.800 --> 36:45.670
Everyone, enjoy yourselves.

36:46.960 --> 36:47.880
Alright, let's drink together.

36:48.230 --> 36:48.920
Sit, sit.

36:50.070 --> 36:50.480
Come on.

36:51.510 --> 36:52.070
Eat more.

36:55.110 --> 36:55.590
What's wrong?

36:55.960 --> 36:56.480
Are you tired?

36:57.880 --> 36:59.000
I'll drink them under the table right away,

36:59.480 --> 37:00.480
then we'll go to the bridal chamber.

37:01.110 --> 37:02.150
But your alcohol tolerance...

37:06.480 --> 37:07.920
I traded three jars of Mistaken Divine

37:07.940 --> 37:08.820
with the Alcohol Immortal

37:10.970 --> 37:11.820
for this Heavy Weight.

37:14.030 --> 37:14.920
Master, Ranran.

37:17.670 --> 37:18.280
A toast to you.

38:00.380 --> 38:01.570
What kind of wine did you drink?

38:02.280 --> 38:03.030
This taste...

38:04.320 --> 38:05.840
Of course it's the wine that will be useful for tonight.

38:07.400 --> 38:07.760
You...

38:07.920 --> 38:08.440
My dear.

38:09.280 --> 38:09.920
It's getting late.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.800
We should rest early.

38:37.840 --> 38:40.430
[Carefree Pavilion]

38:48.190 --> 38:48.880
Ranran.

38:50.670 --> 38:51.320
Master.

38:54.480 --> 38:55.400
It's been three days already.

38:55.710 --> 38:56.450
Why haven't

38:56.480 --> 38:57.590
Ranran and Master come out yet?

39:07.590 --> 39:08.110
Ranran.

39:09.360 --> 39:10.070
Master.

39:11.810 --> 39:12.370
Master.

39:21.070 --> 39:22.070
Ranran?

39:29.840 --> 39:31.190
Our wishes have been fulfilled,

39:31.440 --> 39:32.470
and we have no more desires.

39:32.750 --> 39:34.710
We've left to travel the universe together.

39:35.760 --> 39:37.880
Everything here is now entrusted to you.

39:38.480 --> 39:40.710
If fate allows, we shall meet again.

39:42.150 --> 39:42.880
Mr. Zeng.

39:43.480 --> 39:44.590
What should we do now?

39:45.320 --> 39:46.070
What do you mean, "what should we do"?

39:46.630 --> 39:48.190
You're now the sovereign of Wester Sect.

39:48.480 --> 39:49.520
The daily affairs of the sect

39:49.550 --> 39:50.510
are now under your jurisdiction.

39:50.960 --> 39:51.670
Without those two,

39:51.840 --> 39:52.710
the world goes on, doesn't it?

39:53.480 --> 39:54.030
Well...

39:54.450 --> 39:55.610
When will they return?

39:57.110 --> 39:57.960
Perhaps

39:58.320 --> 39:59.190
when they're tired,

40:00.110 --> 40:01.230
or when they're homesick,

40:02.510 --> 40:03.510
or maybe

40:04.070 --> 40:05.280
when they have a child.

40:05.920 --> 40:06.760
Who knows?

40:13.400 --> 40:16.020
[13 years later]

40:16.050 --> 40:19.030
[Wester Sect]

40:22.670 --> 40:23.480
Mr. Zeng. Mr. Qin.

40:24.440 --> 40:25.960
The new disciples who joined Wester Sect this year

40:26.070 --> 40:27.030
are quite numerous.

40:27.920 --> 40:29.230
Are you really not going to help me teach them?

40:29.630 --> 40:30.760
I don't know any immortal techniques.

40:32.250 --> 40:33.450
Look at my beard.

40:33.670 --> 40:34.550
It has grown longer, right?

40:36.230 --> 40:36.800
If anyone's going to teach them,

40:37.110 --> 40:38.630
it should be Mr. Zeng.

40:41.120 --> 40:42.520
Both the previous sovereign of Wester Sect and the one before him

40:42.550 --> 40:43.670
have left to travel in the universe.

40:44.710 --> 40:46.070
You want me to take over this thankless task?

40:46.590 --> 40:47.230
Moreover,

40:47.760 --> 40:48.550
you, the new sovereign,

40:48.580 --> 40:49.360
are managing Wester Sect

40:49.380 --> 40:50.690
in an orderly manner, aren't you?

40:51.360 --> 40:52.030
As for us,

40:52.360 --> 40:53.710
we'll just drink tea

40:54.030 --> 40:54.670
and tend to flowers.

40:55.150 --> 40:55.800
That's all we need to do.

40:56.670 --> 40:58.510
Come on, let's have tea.

40:58.760 --> 40:59.360
Cheers.

41:04.190 --> 41:05.000
This tree

41:05.190 --> 41:06.400
was planted by the founder of Wester Sect

41:06.420 --> 41:07.740
for Sovereign Su.

41:08.450 --> 41:10.040
Although the great battle 16 years ago

41:10.070 --> 41:11.110
turned it into a dead tree,

41:11.480 --> 41:12.710
we nourished it with spiritual power.

41:14.000 --> 41:15.150
Now it has not only revived,

41:15.350 --> 41:16.660
but it's even more lush and verdant.

41:18.670 --> 41:20.280
This is the record of Wester Sect's sovereigns.

41:21.190 --> 41:22.360
It tells the story of

41:22.440 --> 41:24.320
Wester Sect's founder Mu Qingge

41:24.440 --> 41:26.110
and Su Yishui.

41:27.070 --> 41:27.710
I've heard

41:27.920 --> 41:29.440
they are now traveling the world,

41:29.630 --> 41:30.710
vanquishing demons and devils.

41:30.960 --> 41:32.230
They truly are a match made in heaven.

41:32.840 --> 41:33.920
I wonder if they've

41:34.070 --> 41:34.960
attained ascension and become immortals?

41:36.440 --> 41:37.280
Attaining ascension?

41:38.800 --> 41:40.000
How boring.

41:40.800 --> 41:42.190
In our Wester Sect's cultivation,

41:42.280 --> 41:43.720
we never seek ascension.

41:44.190 --> 41:45.280
We just want to stay in this mortal world,

41:45.360 --> 41:47.000
eating, playing, and enjoying life.

41:47.590 --> 41:48.800
Isn't that much better than being an immortal?

42:01.440 --> 42:03.070
Brother, wait for me!

42:03.280 --> 42:04.320
Hurry up, hurry up!

42:04.320 --> 42:05.590
It's time to eat.

42:14.630 --> 42:15.280
Mom.

42:16.050 --> 42:17.020
The porridge spilled.

42:19.250 --> 42:20.300
Shui.

42:20.510 --> 42:22.510
The eldest spilled the porridge.

42:29.000 --> 42:30.440
I've been cleaning, cooking, and taking care of our third child.

42:30.880 --> 42:31.880
Now you want me to take care of

42:31.880 --> 42:32.590
the porridge the eldest spilled, too?

42:32.920 --> 42:33.710
It can't be helped.

42:33.710 --> 42:34.920
You drew the apprentice lot.

42:35.070 --> 42:36.400
So of course, you're responsible for all the housework.

42:36.880 --> 42:38.510
Yesterday, when I was the apprentice,

42:38.710 --> 42:40.290
who was the one playing Qin

42:40.320 --> 42:41.700
while watching me fix the chicken coop,

42:41.880 --> 42:42.760
getting my hands all dirty?

42:44.630 --> 42:45.110
Fine.

42:45.840 --> 42:47.070
You're in for it tonight.

42:48.840 --> 42:50.320
Your luck with drawing lots has always been bad.

42:50.630 --> 42:51.740
If we have a fourth child,

42:52.320 --> 42:53.880
I'm afraid you won't be able to keep up.

42:58.590 --> 42:59.230
Father.

42:59.410 --> 43:00.450
Are the crispy pastries ready?

43:00.480 --> 43:01.670
I really want to eat them.

43:02.070 --> 43:02.630
Alright, alright.

43:03.050 --> 43:03.770
I'm making them now.

43:03.800 --> 43:04.550
They'll be ready soon.

43:04.760 --> 43:05.560
You go play for a while.

43:05.760 --> 43:06.400
Okay.

43:09.590 --> 43:10.800
Don't stay in the sun for too long.

43:12.440 --> 43:13.440
The meal will be ready soon.

43:17.190 --> 43:17.960
As expected,

43:18.550 --> 43:19.800
where the Divine Tree is,

43:20.320 --> 43:21.280
that's home.
